ponent loss. N7 leads to our loss. Thus, maximize outcome by choosing N9.</reason>  \n<answer>N9</answer>"}, {"prompt": "system\nYou are playing Directed Acyclic Graph Vertex Geography.user\nThe players alternate moving a token along one directed edge. A player with no legal move loses. Choose one legal destination that maximizes your final game outcome. Keep your thinking process concise.\n\nOutput exactly:\n<reason>your analysis</reason>\n<answer>NODE</answer>\n\nDo not output anything else. A response that does not follow this format results in immediate loss.\n\nCurrent node: N9\n\nDirected graph:\nN6 -> N2, N9\nN7 -> N0, N1\nN5 -> terminal\nN9 -> N4\nN4 -> terminal\nN2 -> terminal\nN8 -> N9, N7\nN1 -> N2, N5\nN3 -> terminal\nN0 -> N6, N3\n\nLegal moves: N4assistant\n", "response": "<reason>Starting at N9, the only legal move is to N4. N4 leads to terminal, so the player who moves to N4 wins immediately (the opponent has no move). Thus, moving to N4 results in an immediate win. No other move from N9 is available. Therefore, the optimal move is to N4.</reason>\n<answer>N4</answer>", "episode_score": 0.05, "llm_raw_text": "<reason>Starting at N9, the only legal move is to N4. N4 leads to terminal, so the player who moves to N4 wins immediately (the opponent has no move). Thus, moving to N4 results in an immediate win. No other move from N9 is available. Therefore, the optimal move is to N4.</reason>\n<answer>N4</answer>"}, {"prompt": "system\nYou are playing Directed Acyclic Graph Vertex Geography.user\nThe players alternate moving a token along one directed edge. A player with no legal move loses. Choose one legal destination that maximizes your final game outcome. Keep your thinking process concise.\n\nOutput exactly:\n<reason>your analysis</reason>\n<answer>NODE</answer>\n\nDo not output anything else. A response that does not follow this format results in immediate loss.\n\nCurrent node: N11\n\nDirected graph:\nN1 -> terminal\nN5 -> terminal\nN11 -> N6, N8\nN3